{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39127","headline":"耒阳县浮山神庙 · 韦庄","name":"耒阳县浮山神庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一郡皆传此庙灵，庙前松桂古今青。\n山曾尧代浮洪水，地有唐臣奠绿醽。\n遶坐香风吹宝盖，傍檐烟雨湿岩扃。\n爲霖自可成农岁，何用兴师远伐邢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}